x86_64-windows  a destructible local and a `try` in one function is refused for this target: a Microsoft cleanup is a funclet and a state in the FH3 tables rather than a row in a call-site list, and the splitting the Itanium path learned has no counterpart there yet. The class-typed throw and catch this case also needs landed for this target on 2026-09-26 (throw-class-pointer-ms.cpp runs here); try-body-local.notarget records the local refusal from the other side.
